Package: senaceR
Title: Programmatic Access to SENACE Open Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Paul Efren", "Santos Andrade",
    email = "paulfrenes@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
  )
Description: Provides an 'R' interface for the REST API of the 'SENACE' Open Data 
    Portal (National Service for Environmental Certification of Sustainable 
    Investments) in Peru <https://datosabiertos.senace.gob.pe>. Allows users to 
    download current datasets programmatically using a personal API key directly 
    from official active endpoints.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    tibble
Suggests: 
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
